#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/opacity_and_flow.rst:35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In Krita 4.1 and below, the flow and opacity when combined with brush "
"sensors would add up to one another, being only limited by the maximum "
"opacity. This was unexpected compared to all other painting applications, so "
"in 4.2 this finally got corrected to the flow and opacity multiplying, "
"resulting in much more subtle strokes. This change can be switched back in "
"the :ref:`tool_options_settings`, but we will be deprecating the old way in "
"future versions."
msgstr ""
"V Kriti 4.1 in starejših bi se pretok in prekrivnost v kombinaciji s tipali "
"čopiča med seboj seštela, pri tem pa bi bila omejena le z največjo "
"prekrivnostjo. To je bilo nepričakovano v primerjavi z vsemi drugimi "
"slikarskimi aplikacijami, tako da je to v 4.2 končno popravljeno na množenje "
"pretoka in prekrivnosti, kar je povzročilo veliko bolj nežne poteze. To "
"spremembo je mogoče preklopiti nazaj v :ref:`tool_options_settings`, vendar "
"bo pri prihodnjih različicah stari način opuščen."

